{{#> email-base previewText="We appreciate your effort — here's an update on your interview"}}
  {{#*inline "body"}}
    <p class="label">Interview result</p>
    <h1>Thank you for your effort, {{firstName}}</h1>
    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p>
      We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into your interview, and we want you to know that this decision was not made lightly.
    </p>
    <p>
      After careful review, we were unfortunately unable to move your application forward at this time. Please don&apos;t be discouraged — this is not a reflection of your worth or potential, and we would love to see you try again.
    </p>
    {{#if retryDate}}
    <p>
      You are welcome to retake the interview from <strong>{{retryDate}}</strong>. We encourage you to use this time to review your responses, revisit any feedback on your dashboard, and come back feeling more prepared.
    </p>
    {{else}}
    <p>
      You are welcome to retake the interview in <strong>21 days</strong>. We encourage you to use this time to review your responses, revisit any feedback on your dashboard, and come back feeling more prepared.
    </p>
    {{/if}}
    <p>
      We are rooting for you and hope to see you back soon.
    </p>
    <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Go to your dashboard</a>
    <p style="margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:#888">
      If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
      <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="color:#888">{{dashboardUrl}}</a>
    </p>
  {{/inline}}
{{/email-base}}
